{
 "about": "THE BOOT SENTINEL'S GET CENSUS (scripts/test-boot-sentinel.mjs ③, lane affected-static-reach): every GET /api route the server files register (scripts/reach-model.mjs getRoutes) is in exactly one list — smoke (called on a scratch boot: non-5xx, JSON parses, within budgetMs) or skip (never called here, with the reason). A new GET in neither list is RED in test-reach-model (fast) and in the sentinel. query = the query a route needs (a {path} / {txt} / {png} / {dir} / {cwd} / {sid} / {task} fill — the sentinel's own fixture files); answers = a 5xx a route gives ON PURPOSE on a scratch boot, with why.",
